      "fixed": true,
      "fixed_in": "14514d66dbcdd4236a9d18dcbc79c1d90d9a14a1",
      "id": "FIXTURE-REFUSALS-TRIPPED-THE-LIVE-MONITOR",
      "kind": "defect, fixed in this work",
      "note": "the health monitor's failure streak (threshold 3) and its 45-minute liveness grace were computed over every run event, including the fixtures, so the verification practice itself could raise a false CRITICAL and could mask a stopped schedule. The streak and the heartbeat are now derived from the non-manual events, with the unrecorded historical rows deliberately still counted."
    },
